  "enhancedExcluded": true,
  "mapping": "Actual positive paid weapon finalblows accrue bounded kill credit on the original source through stow. A genuinely accepted timed reload consumes preceding credit at its ammunition-credit transaction. Additional loaded cartridges are transferred from reserves (or the existing infinite Primary supply), never generated for finite weapons. Extra loaded authorization is persisted separately from legacy overflow debt."
